Name Brotherhood T-51b Power Armor Helmet
Description <color=#FFB642>43 Damage Resistance</color><br><color=#FFB642>-4 Agility</color><br><color=#FFB642>High tech power armor, made out of poly-laminate composite and powered by a back-mounted TX-28 MicroFusion Pack which generates an output power of 60,000 Watts to power the HiFlo hydraulic systems built into the frame of the suit. Provides extreme protection.</color>